@LocalHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Health check (public)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### E01 - Register a client account (public)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste Registo",
  "email": "teste.registo@localhub.test",
  "password": "casa2026",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### E01 - Invalid fields and ADMIN role (expect 400 with errors per field)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalido",
  "password": "curta",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### E02 - Log in (public); the password is Seed:DefaultPassword from appsettings.Development.json
# @name login
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.almeida@localhub.test",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}"
}

### E02 - Wrong password (expect 401 credenciais-invalidas)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.almeida@localhub.test",
  "password": "errada123"
}

### E04 - Authenticated user
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E04 - Without token (expect 401)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me

### E03 - Log out (expect 204); afterwards the same token gets 401 on E04
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
